# Drafted with gateway-composer (library/compose/Modelfile), grounded in the
# Gateway Experience Guidance Manual (wave-i-discovery.md, "Focus 3"), the
# Orientation transcript, and the owner's description of light relaxation.
# Revised 2026-08-21 when F3 became the first deliberate onboarding session:
# later tapes pass through it, but the first visit stops long enough to learn
# what that shallow state feels like.

@segment  briefing-f3
@title    Focus 3
@levels   F3
@duration ~15s

say You're at Focus 3 now.
pause 3
say In later sessions, Focus 3 is a brief signpost on the way to Focus 10. Here, for your first visit, simply notice this light relaxation and the more coherent pattern of mind and brain.
pause 6
